# Array Operations (Insert, Delete, Search, Update, Traverse)

## Problem Statement :- 
To implement array operations like insert , delete etc.

## Pseudocode :-

INSERT(arr, size, pos, value):
    if size == MAX or pos < 0 or pos > size: return ERROR
    for i = size down to pos + 1:
        arr[i] = arr[i-1]
    arr[pos] = value
    size = size + 1

DELETE(arr, size, pos):
    if pos < 0 or pos >= size: return ERROR
    for i = pos to size - 2:
        arr[i] = arr[i+1]
    size = size - 1

LINEAR_SEARCH(arr, size, key):
    for i = 0 to size - 1:
        if arr[i] == key: return i
    return -1

UPDATE(arr, size, pos, value):
    if pos < 0 or pos >= size: return ERROR
    arr[pos] = value


## Flowchart :-
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Input pos, value/]
    B --> C{size == MAX?}
    C -- Yes --> E[Array full] --> Z([End])
    C -- No --> D{0 <= pos <= size?}
    D -- No --> F[Invalid position] --> Z
    D -- Yes --> G[Shift elements right from pos]
    G --> H[arr pos = value]
    H --> I[size++]
    I --> Z
```

## Time & Space Complexity :-
| Operation | Best | Worst | Space |

| Traverse | O(n) | O(n) | O(1) |
| Insert | O(1) (end me) | O(n) (start me) | O(1) |
| Delete | O(1) (last) | O(n) (first) | O(1) |
| Search (Linear) | O(1) | O(n) | O(1) |
| Update | O(1) | O(1) | O(1) |


